This folder is original code, written for Schedule Visualizer 2
(greyversusblue.com) in October 2026 from the published QR code standard,
ISO/IEC 18004. No code was copied from another QR library: there is no
third-party code here and so no third party's licence to carry. The
version tables, the generator polynomials and the masks are the standard's
own facts.

It is part of the tools-and-games repository and is under the same terms
as the rest of that repository.
